	assets/img/beamflix.png = Mecha BeamFlix projector icon supplied by the application project
	assets/img/social-preview-v1.png = 1200 by 630 PNG served to social link-preview crawlers
	assets/img/social-preview-v1.svg = Editable source for the company link-preview card
	assets/img/social-preview-v2.png = Updated Tools for GSD correctly social card
	assets/img/social-preview-v2.svg = Editable source for the updated social card
	assets/js/checkout-config.mjs = Public disabled-by-default Paddle client token, price, and capability-matrix configuration
	assets/js/checkout.mjs = Pure checkout classifier plus accessible fail-closed Paddle.js browser adapter
	assets/js/i18n.mjs = Browser language picker, saved choice and accessible tooltips
	assets/js/locale.mjs = Pure 50-locale matching, preference precedence and URL routing
	build = Checks shipped JavaScript, Lua preview syntax, and required static entrypoints
	contact/index.html = Contact page (email + obfuscated phone + company)
	docs/I18N.md = Translation workflow, quality limits, language selection and sources
	docs/MECHA_RELEASE_PLAN.md = Canonical LOCKED commercial release plan (gitignored: internal strategy, public repo)
	docs/checkout.md = Public checkout configuration, fulfillment boundary, and Paddle references
	docs/i18n-review-samples.md = Locale samples with English meaning reconstructions and snapshot hashes
	docs/i18n-review.md = Independent translation review findings and limits
	docs/localized-slogans.md = Localized headline idioms, intended meanings and tone review
	flake.nix = Reproducible static-site package, full test check, and LuaJIT/Node development shell
	i18n = Source-keyed catalogs for all supported website languages
	legal/privacy/index.html = Privacy Policy (anonymous telemetry, Paddle payment data, no PII)
	legal/refund/index.html = Refund policy (30-day money-back, 24-mo cooldown, Paddle-issued)
	legal/terms/index.html = Terms of Service (Paddle MoR disclosure, NY governing law placeholder)
	scripts/localization.mjs = Pure static HTML phrase extraction and localized page rendering
	scripts/localize.mjs = Explicit generation and read-only verification of 50 static language editions
	scripts/render-mfic = Generates /thoughts/mfic/ from canonical ~/Documents/MFIC.md (pandoc, gfm); no-drift single source
	scripts/translation-policy.mjs = Reviewed locale-specific notice policy and legal source links
	test = Master Bash test runner: runs tests/*.sh, accumulates failures, exit = fail count
	tests/encoding-integrity.sh = Set-classifier: no double/triple-encoded UTF-8 (mojibake) in any tracked text file
	tests/footer-consistency.sh = Set-classifier: every served HTML page links all 4 legal/contact surfaces
	tests/mfic-no-drift.sh = Drift gate: re-renders MFIC page from source, fails if committed HTML stale (skips if source absent)
	tests/policy-pages.sh = Asserts Paddle-required legal pages exist with required sections
	tests/pricing.sh = Asserts displayed prices: $49.99/app per card + $79.99 self-identified bundle
	tests/product-naming.sh = Set-classifier: finalized product names present, retired/shelved names absent everywhere
	tests/social-preview.test.mjs = Verify preview metadata and image dimensions for main content pages
	tests/thoughts-mfic.sh = Asserts MFIC page buyer-framing + core + gist link + cross-links
	tests/validate-open-core.sh = Scoped check: Validate card conveys open-core model (free CLI/lib, paid GUI, reserved rights)
	tests/work-incitez.sh = Asserts incitez showcase content + honest framing + demo link + repo-link gate (no GitHub link until BSL)
	thoughts/index.html = /thoughts/ index (thought-leadership; seeds future essays)
	thoughts/mfic/index.html = MFIC methodology page (buyer-framed; core rendered from ~/Documents/MFIC.md via pandoc; gist for deep dive)
	work/incitez/index.html = incitez case study: verified-parity-first vs eyecite, ~31x, demo CTA; repo link gated on BSL
	work/index.html = /work/ index (case-study listing)
]
